			<div class="content" id="post-content-2446679">
									

<p>While this skip is a good idea, there are a number of problems with the execution. If you fix the issues I would probably upvote, but presently this skip earns a downvote.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;issues</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
