<p>The problem also surfaces with people sharing that name. For your statement that there's only one vector left at this time to make sense, you'd have to have a name that is sufficiently unique to never have been chosen before. Since you've chosen to make it <em>just</em> the last name, it's going to be really hard convincing your reader of the plausibility of that claim (that there's only one vector left).</p>
